From fc7457f6c7a2b7e66469b5ae23b2fff6985103ff Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: swarm-inference-lab downstream <downstream@example.invalid>
Date: Sun, 2 Aug 2026 22:47:40 +1000
Subject: [PATCH] olmoe native quantized microshards

Downstream Experiment 010 integration under Apache-2.0. Execute exact native-int8 gate, up, and down slices through the shared expert runtime and reduce partials in stable router order inside the Colibri model path.

---
